  "bodyHash": "629e1c101837528f",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《Let's Parkour》為遊戲增添了多種跑酷方塊，讓您能構築精彩的跑酷路線。本模組是為「ModFest: Carnival」活動而開發。它為玩家提供了讓跑酷路線變得更加有趣的工具。將多個半磚疊放可以增強每個方塊的效果。可單獨啟用或停用各種跑酷方塊。<br><br>目前包含：緩速、高速、跳躍、柔軟、膠囊、滑溜、幻象與活板門跑酷方塊。請見下方查看其合成表與功能說明。<br></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/a.webp\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">跑酷方塊的效果可透過疊放來增強：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/a2.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端 &amp; 伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSlowParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用緩速跑酷方塊功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用高速跑酷方塊功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableJumpParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用跳躍跑酷方塊功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSoftParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用柔軟跑酷方塊功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableJellyParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用膠囊跑酷方塊功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableSlipperyParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用滑溜跑酷方塊功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrapdoorParkourBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否啟用活板門方塊功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>slowBlockBaseSpeedFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：0.5</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">緩速跑酷方塊的基礎速度係數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>fastBlockBaseSpeedFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：1.5</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">高速跑酷方塊的基礎速度係數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>jumpBlockBaseJumpFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：2.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">跳躍跑酷方塊的基礎跳躍係數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>slipperyBlockBaseFrictionFactor</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：0.95</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">滑溜跑酷方塊的基礎摩擦係數。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"說明\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>跑酷方塊：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">基礎跑酷半磚。可作為一般方塊使用，並用於所有其他配方中。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/b.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">緩速跑酷半磚會減緩在上面行走的玩家速度。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/c.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高速跑酷半磚會加速在上面行走的玩家。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/d.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">跳躍跑酷半磚讓玩家站在上面時能跳得更高。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/e.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">柔軟跑酷半磚在落地時完全防止摔落傷害。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/f.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">膠囊跑酷半磚具有黏性，玩家進入其中時會減緩速度。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/g.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">滑溜跑酷半磚摩擦力較低，會使玩家在上方滑行。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/h.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">幻象跑酷半磚外觀類似基礎跑酷方塊，但玩家會直接穿過掉落。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/i.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">活板門方塊允許玩家在其上短暫站立，隨後便會打開。</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/j.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">小心活板門跑酷方塊！</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/lets-parkour/a3.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何模組包中自由使用本模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤評論，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 倉庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
